        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8 2v8M8 10l-3-3M8 10l3-3M3 13h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
      <p class="dl-fine">Keep Steam running and make sure Rust is fully closed before opening the loader.</p>
    </section>

