      <h2 class="dl-h2"><span class="dl-step">!</span> Before you start</h2>
      <p class="dl-p">Your download folder includes a setup file with the security configuration steps required before first launch. Follow the included instructions in that folder first, then continue with the loader setup below.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- LOADER SETUP -->
    <section class="dl-card dl-rise" style="--d:.24s">
      <h2 class="dl-h2"><span class="dl-step">1</span> Loader setup</h2>
      <p class="dl-muted dl-mb">Make sure Rust is completely closed, but Steam <strong>must</strong> be running before opening the loader.</p>
      <ol class="dl-list">
        <li><strong>Launch the loader:</strong> run the executable as Administrator.</li>
        <li><strong>Authenticate:</strong> enter your license key.</li>
